"Enable Free idle inactive terminals in Settings → Terminal to reclaim memory. Local terminals without a background session reopen a fresh shell in the same folder; background-session terminals reattach." = "在“设置 → 终端”中启用“释放空闲的非活动终端”以回收内存。没有后台会话的本地终端会在同一文件夹中重新打开新的 shell；有后台会话的终端会重新附着。";
"Enable Auto-copy selected text in Settings → Terminal to copy a terminal selection as soon as you release the mouse." = "在“设置 → 终端”中启用“自动复制所选文本”，以便松开鼠标时立即拷贝终端所选内容。";
"Command-click a file path in a local terminal, or a link in any terminal, to open it." = "在本地终端中按住 Command 并点按文件路径，或在任意终端中点按链接即可打开。";
