"By default, ⌘⌥↩ maximizes the selected split pane. Press it again to restore the full layout." = "默认情况下，⌘⌥↩ 会最大化所选拆分窗格。再次按下可还原完整布局。";
"By default, ⌘⌥ plus an arrow key focuses a neighboring split pane." = "默认情况下，⌘⌥ 加上方向键可聚焦相邻的拆分窗格。";
"By default, Control-Tab and Control-Shift-Tab focus the next or previous visible pane across the current layout." = "默认情况下，Control-Tab 和 Control-Shift-Tab 可在当前布局中聚焦下一个或上一个可见窗格。";
"Hold ⌘ and drag inside a terminal to move its pane to another area or create a split." = "在终端内按住 ⌘ 并拖移，可将窗格移到其他区域或创建拆分。";
"Right-click a tab to pin, recolor, rename, or close the tabs to its left, right, or all other tabs." = "右键点按标签页可固定、重新着色、重命名，或关闭其左侧、右侧或所有其他标签页。";
"By default, ⌘I opens the Composer for multiline text, files, and images that you can send to the focused terminal." = "默认情况下，⌘I 会打开 Composer，用于可将多行文本、文件和图像发送到聚焦终端。";
"Use Send Without Enter in the Composer's More menu to send text to the selected target—either the active pane or all split panes—without sending a Return keystroke." = "在 Composer 的“更多”菜单中使用“发送但不按 Return”，可将文本发送到所选目标——活动窗格或所有拆分窗格——而不发送 Return 按键。";
"With an on-device dictation language installed and microphone and speech recognition access allowed, ⌘⇧I starts dictation by default while the Composer is open. Stop dictation or press Return to insert the transcript at the cursor." = "在已安装设备端听写语言并允许麦克风与语音识别访问的情况下，默认在 Composer 打开时按 ⌘⇧I 开始听写。停止听写或按 Return 可在光标处插入转录。";
"By default, in a browser tab, press ⌘⌥I or choose Inspect Element from the right-click menu to open Web Inspector." = "默认情况下，在浏览器标签页中按 ⌘⌥I，或从右键菜单选择“检查元素”以打开 Web Inspector。";
"Create browser profiles in Settings → Browser to keep cookies and logins separate, or import cookies from Chrome." = "在“设置 → 浏览器”中创建浏览器配置文件以分开 Cookie 和登录状态，或从 Chrome 导入 Cookie。";
"By default, ⌘⌥O searches open tabs, ⌘⌥P projects, ⌘⌥W worktrees, and ⌘⌥S workspaces." = "默认情况下，⌘⌥O 搜索打开的标签页，⌘⌥P 搜索项目，⌘⌥W 搜索工作树，⌘⌥S 搜索工作区。";
"Create reusable commands in Settings → Commands. By default, ⌘⇧P opens their picker." = "在“设置 → 命令”中创建可复用命令。默认情况下，⌘⇧P 打开其选择器。";
"Assign a global shortcut in Settings → Quick Terminal to open it from any app while Muxy runs. Double Shift requires Input Monitoring; its shell stays alive while hidden." = "在“设置 → 快速终端”中分配全局快捷键，以便在 Muxy 运行时从任何 App 打开它。连按 Shift 需要“输入监控”；其 shell 在隐藏时仍保持运行。";
"In a local workspace, open Add Project → Recently Removed to restore a removed project whose folder still exists, without changing its files." = "在本地工作区中，打开“添加项目 → 最近移除”可恢复文件夹仍存在的已移除项目，且不更改其文件。";
"Install the muxy CLI from the Muxy menu to script splits, send keys, and read visible terminal output. [Read the CLI docs](https://muxy.app/docs/features/muxy-cli)." = "从 Muxy 菜单安装 muxy CLI，以编写拆分脚本、发送按键并读取可见的终端输出。[阅读 CLI 文档](https://muxy.app/docs/features/muxy-cli)。";
"Muxy can track supported coding agents and notify you when a turn finishes or needs input. Check Settings → Notifications." = "Muxy 可以跟踪受支持的编程智能体，并在一轮结束或需要输入时通知你。请查看"设置 → 通知"。";
"Try Muxy 2 Beta, rewritten in Rust to be faster, more efficient, and a true multiplexer. It installs as a separate app next to this one. [Download Muxy 2 Beta](https://github.com/muxy-app/muxy/releases?q=v2.0.0-beta-)." = "试用 Muxy 2 Beta：它使用 Rust 重写，更快、更高效，并且是真正的多路复用器。它会作为独立 App 安装在当前 App 旁边。[下载 Muxy 2 Beta](https://github.com/muxy-app/muxy/releases?q=v2.0.0-beta-)。";
